  "visible_text": "VOXEL DELIVERY / HEARTHLIFT COURIER\n\nCarry the marked crate to the ember hearth.\n\nCarry the marked crate to the glowing hearth. Inspect the terraced 3D garden, push helper crates into useful same-height cells, climb their tops, return for the cargo, and carry it through the changed route to the hearth. Use only screenshots and visible controls in the task webpage. Do not use code, scripts, automation, Developer Tools, console, debugger, inspector, network, source, DOM or page-state inspection, terminal, shell, Python, address-bar or URL/query edits, reload or navigation, browser extensions, external applications, hidden state, or unrelated tabs.\n\nWORLD\n3D STACK\nDIRECT INPUT\nROTATE THE GARDEN TO INSPECT DEPTH\nCAMERA -15\u00b0 \u00b7 VISIBILITY 72% FOG\nHEARTH\nSTEP\nDECOY\nSTEP\nDECOY\nSTEP\nSTEP\nDECOY\nCOURIER\nPush a crate to make a step. CLIMB its top, then cross the higher ledge. The glowing hearth is the only delivery point.\n\nCOURIER LEDGER\n\nPOSITION\n17, 1\nFEET Z 4\nCARGO\nDELIVERED\nCAMERA\n\u2014\n\nDIRECT INPUT\n\nWASD or ARROWS move\nC climbs an adjacent crate\nE picks up or drops cargo\n\nDrag the voxel garden itself to orbit. Camera motion changes the view, not the route.\n\nVISIBLE RULES\n\nCrates at your feet can be pushed into an empty same-height cell.\nUse CLIMB / C when a crate top is one voxel above you.\nReturn for the marked crate, then carry it to the hearth.\nABANDON ATTEMPT\nCERTIFY DELIVERY\nPASS"
